      "text": "SEUGH. A wet ditch; a drain. North. \" The towne sinke, the common sew,\" Nomenclator, 1585, p. 391.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5125352112676056,
        "y0": 0.5351310344827586,
        "x1": 0.7477521126760563,
        "y1": 0.5487827586206897
      },
      "text": "SEUNE. Seven. Cumb.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5121295774647887,
        "y0": 0.5478724137931035,
        "x1": 0.9428816901408451,
        "y1": 0.5626862068965517
      },
      "text": "SEUREMENT. Security, generally used in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5331802816901409,
        "y0": 0.5654068965517242,
        "x1": 0.7279070422535211,
        "y1": 0.5754275862068965
      },
      "text": "legal sense. (A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5117239436619718,
        "y0": 0.5752620689655172,
        "x1": 0.8319492957746478,
        "y1": 0.589253448275862
      },
      "text": "SEURETEE. Certainty. (A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5113183098591549,
        "y0": 0.5884258620689655,
        "x1": 0.9416676056338027,
        "y1": 0.6036758620689655
      },
      "text": "SEVEN-NIGHT. A week. This word occurs",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5319661971830987,
        "y0": 0.6033896551724138,
        "x1": 0.8675859154929577,
        "y1": 0.6163965517241379
      },
      "text": "in The French Alphabet, 1615, p. 18.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5700225352112677,
        "y0": 0.6156999999999999,
        "x1": 0.8064478873239437,
        "y1": 0.6277120689655172
      },
      "text": "He levyth not oon sevevyghte.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.732769014084507,
        "y0": 0.6292517241379311,
        "x1": 0.9416676056338027,
        "y1": 0.6398534482758621
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 63.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5105098591549295,
        "y0": 0.6398465517241378,
        "x1": 0.9412647887323944,
        "y1": 0.680098275862069
      },
      "text": "SEVEN-YEAR. \" Has been a vile thief this seven year,\" Shakespeare. It was a proverbial expression for a long time.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5684028169014084,
        "y0": 0.6817034482758622,
        "x1": 0.7538281690140844,
        "y1": 0.6919655172413793
      },
      "text": "O, the body of a Gorge,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5684028169014084,
        "y0": 0.693346551724138,
        "x1": 0.7619154929577465,
        "y1": 0.7039137931034483
      },
      "text": "I wold I had them heare",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7671802816901409,
        "y0": 0.700151724137931,
        "x1": 0.770825352112676,
        "y1": 0.7040724137931034
      },
      "text": ";",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5679971830985916,
        "y0": 0.7057413793103449,
        "x1": 0.7951211267605633,
        "y1": 0.7158431034482758
      },
      "text": "In faith, I wold chope them,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5675915492957747,
        "y0": 0.7160586206896551,
        "x1": 0.8853943661971831,
        "y1": 0.727546551724138
      },
      "text": "Thay ware not so hack this seven yeere '",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6574676056338028,
        "y0": 0.7294344827586208,
        "x1": 0.9388366197183098,
        "y1": 0.740148275862069
      },
      "text": "Mariage of Witt and TVisdomet 1579.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5675915492957747,
        "y0": 0.7430482758620689,
        "x1": 0.8449042253521126,
        "y1": 0.7534275862068965
      },
      "text": "I can then thanke Sensuall Apetyte",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5671887323943662,
        "y0": 0.7538086206896552,
        "x1": 0.883374647887324,
        "y1": 0.7766344827586207
      },
      "text": "That is the best daunce without a pype That I saw this seven yere.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6522056338028168,
        "y0": 0.7795017241379311,
        "x1": 0.9388366197183098,
        "y1": 0.789748275862069
      },
      "text": "Interlude of the Four Elements, n. d.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.508081690140845,
        "y0": 0.7903206896551724,
        "x1": 0.9392394366197183,
        "y1": 0.8317275862068966
      },
      "text": "SEVERALS. Portions of common assigned for a term to a particular proprietor, the other commoners waiving for the time their right",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07894366197183098,
        "y0": 0.8149637931034482,
        "x1": 0.4886422535211267,
        "y1": 0.837248275862069
      },
      "text": "Fowles of hcven er prowde inow that wald heglie thalre aetille aboven alle other fesshe of the se.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5291323943661972,
        "y0": 0.8307224137931035,
        "x1": 0.9380281690140845,
        "y1": 0.8456362068965517
      },
      "text": "of common over them. See Hunter on",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29715492957746475,
        "y0": 0.8384689655172414,
        "x1": 0.48743380281690135,
        "y1": 0.8497965517241379
      },
      "text": "MS. Coll. Eton. 10, f. 13.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5303464788732394,
        "y0": 0.8465120689655172,
        "x1": 0.7092845070422535,
        "y1": 0.8576637931034483
      },
      "text": "Shakespeare, i. 267.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11376056338028169,
        "y0": 0.8515189655172414,
        "x1": 0.3505887323943662,
        "y1": 0.8626948275862069
      },
      "text": "Apon the aetyl of hys majesty",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5072704225352113,
        "y0": 0.8568706896551724,
        "x1": 0.9384309859154929,
        "y1": 0.8860706896551724
      },
      "text": "SEVERY. A division or compartment of a vaulted ceihng. \" Severous of a howse,\" MS.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11497464788732395,
        "y0": 0.8634362068965518,
        "x1": 0.4076816901408451,
        "y1": 0.8754913793103448
      },
      "text": "That day sal alle men before hym be.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2639577464788732,
        "y0": 0.8762431034482758,
        "x1": 0.4882394366197183,
        "y1": 0.8874258620689655
      },
      "text": "Hampole, MS. Bowes, p. 180.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05627323943661972,
        "y0": 0.8868706896551725,
        "x1": 0.26923098591549294,
        "y1": 0.9000379310344827
      },
      "text": "SETLINGS. Saplings.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5287267605633803,
        "y0": 0.8869758620689655,
        "x1": 0.6866169014084507,
        "y1": 0.897846551724138
      },
      "text": "Dictionary, 1540.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5072704225352113,
        "y0": 0.8972672413793104,
        "x1": 0.7825661971830985,
        "y1": 0.9121568965517242
      },
      "text": "SEW. (1) Same as Assue, q. v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07894366197183098,
        "y0": 0.9027620689655173,
        "x1": 0.48824225352112677,
        "y1": 0.9379896551724138
      },
      "text": "For such as be yet infirm and weak, and newly planted in the religion of Christ, and have taken no sure root in the same, are easily moved as young",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5072704225352113,
        "y0": 0.9127793103448276,
        "x1": 0.6724507042253521,
        "y1": 0.9251051724137931
      },
      "text": "(2) Sowed. Line.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5072704225352113,
        "y0": 0.9252724137931034,
        "x1": 0.9372112676056338,
        "y1": 0.9513034482758621
      },
      "text": "(3) To wipe the ))eak, a term in ancient hawking given by Berners.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
